[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_06030000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_06030000_01_0010","text":"──那么，这次以“素颜”为概念，\n希望您能考虑一下自然的服装和发型────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_06030000_01_0011","text":"造型师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_06030000_01_0020","text":"嗯……原来如此……？\n很乖的提案嘛，boy……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_06030000_01_0030","text":"…………………………\nBoy……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_06030000_01_0040","text":"是的，boy……\n但是non-non，non-non darling……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_06030000_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_06030000_01_0050","text":"原封不动的素颜是二流，\n挖掘出本人都不知晓的真正素颜才是一流……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_06030000_01_0060","text":"……那个秘诀……想知道吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_06030000_01_0070","text":"诶……是的……！\n请您务必赐教──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_06030000_01_0080","text":"OK，boy……\n跟我来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_06030000_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_06030000_01_0090","text":"给女孩们撒上魅惑的香料，\n让我们大干一场吧…………！"}]
